nd many of the issues that  have come up uh quite recently and of  course intensely aware of the shameful  legacy of slavery which is always going  to be the elephant in the room when  you're when you're going on on tours  like this so i think he's handled it  very well i think some of the optics  have been dreadful i mean really kind of  colonial pictures  presumably not particularly his fault  but i think he was absolutely right to  say this and good on him and you know  this stuff is really outdated and of  course it has to be their choice and and  that's just a fact so it's good that he  stated it with grace and dignity we must  leave it there uh thank you both very  much

